# Always package the desktop installer

After finishing code changes that affect the running app, rebuild the installer without asking.

- Command: `npm run desktop:build` from the repo root
- Output: `dist-installer/TxtNote_0.1.0_x64-setup.exe`
- Do this even if the user did not mention packaging
- Tell the user the installer path when the build finishes
